WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:18.000
Every computer collects clutter. But cleaning it should never feel like handing control to a black box.

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:40.000
Ask in plain language. Preview the exact consequence. Approve. Verify. Undo.

00:00:40.000 --> 00:01:12.000
Cubby is the on-screen interface: a local, safety-first assistant for everyday computer work.

00:01:12.000 --> 00:01:48.000
Before anything changes, Custodian measures the selection. No preview, no change.

00:01:48.000 --> 00:02:22.000
Approved operations are bounded, checked against the source, and recorded in a receipt.

00:02:22.000 --> 00:02:52.000
If a source changes or a destination conflicts, Custodian refuses instead of guessing.

00:02:52.000 --> 00:03:20.000
Undo is evidence-aware. Later edits are preserved rather than silently destroyed.

00:03:20.000 --> 00:03:44.000
Tauri and React. Rust supervision. Authenticated IPC. Local agent and workflows.

00:03:44.000 --> 00:04:00.000
Preview. Verify. Recover. Custodian.
